    <string name="maladie_cmd_nom">Mosaiki ya muhogo</string>
    <string name="maladie_cmd_nature">Virusi</string>
    <string name="maladie_cmd_desc">Ugonjwa wa virusi unaenezwa na inzi weupe na vipandikizi vilivyoambukizwa. Hupunguza sana mavuno.</string>
    <string name="maladie_cmd_symptomes">Madoa ya manjano na kijani kama mosaiki, majani yaliyopinda, mmea uliodumaa.</string>
    <string name="maladie_cmd_cause">Virusi vya mosaiki ya muhogo, vinavyoenezwa na inzi weupe na vipandikizi vilivyougua.</string>
    <string name="maladie_cmd_prevention1">Tumia vipandikizi vyenye afya, vilivyochukuliwa kwenye mimea isiyo na dalili.</string>
    <string name="maladie_cmd_prevention2">Ng\'oa na uharibu mimea inayoonekana wazi kuwa imeugua.</string>
    <string name="maladie_cmd_prevention3">Punguza inzi weupe na uulize ushauri kuhusu aina zinazostahimili.</string>
    <string name="maladie_cmd_conseil1">Usihamishe vipandikizi kutoka shamba lililoambukizwa kwenda shamba salama.</string>
    <string name="maladie_cmd_conseil2">Mimea mingi ikiathirika, wasiliana na fundi wa kilimo.</string>
