    <string name="maladie_cbsd_nature">Virusi</string>
    <string name="maladie_cbsd_desc">Ugonjwa wa virusi unaenezwa na inzi weupe na vipandikizi vilivyoambukizwa. Unaweza kuharibu mizizi hata kama majani yanaonekana kuathirika kidogo.</string>
    <string name="maladie_cbsd_symptomes">Manjano kando ya mishipa ya jani. Shina na mizizi vinaweza kuharibika bila dalili wazi kwenye majani.</string>
    <string name="maladie_cbsd_cause">Virusi vya mstari wa kahawia, vinavyoenezwa na inzi weupe na vipandikizi vilivyougua.</string>
    <string name="maladie_cbsd_prevention1">Tumia vipandikizi vyenye afya, vilivyochukuliwa kwenye mimea isiyo na dalili.</string>
    <string name="maladie_cbsd_prevention2">Kagua mashamba mara kwa mara, hasa baada ya mvua za kwanza.</string>
    <string name="maladie_cbsd_prevention3">Ng\'oa na uharibu mimea iliyougua.</string>
    <string name="maladie_cbsd_conseil1">Usipande tena kutoka kwenye mimea iliyoathirika.</string>
    <string name="maladie_cbsd_conseil2">Mizizi inaweza kuathirika hata kama majani yanaonekana sawa: uliza ushauri kwa fundi.</string>
